# STRAT-008: Customer Success OKRs 2024

**Document ID:** STRAT-008
**Title:** Customer Success Objectives and Key Results (OKRs) for Fiscal Year 2024
**Owner:** Jennifer Lee, VP of Customer Success
**Date:** January 17, 2024
**Status:** Final

---

## 1. Executive Summary

The Customer Success (CS) organization is strategically aligned to maximize customer lifetime value (LTV) by driving product adoption, ensuring exceptional customer satisfaction, and fostering revenue expansion. The FY2024 OKRs focus on elevating our Net Revenue Retention (NRR) above 120%, significantly improving the Net Promoter Score (NPS) across all product lines, and scaling our CS operations to support MedSync Health's growth towards its IPO goal.

*Cross-Reference: For detailed financial projections, including the FY 2024 Total Revenue target of **AED 485,100,000**, please refer to **FIN-001: FY2024 Financial Plan**.*

---

## 2. FY 2024 Objectives and Key Results (OKRs)

### Objective 1: Maximize Customer Lifetime Value (LTV) through best-in-class retention and expansion.

This objective focuses on the financial health of our customer base, ensuring that our retention and upsell efforts drive Net Revenue Retention (NRR) to a world-class level.

| Key Result (KR) | Metric | Baseline (FY2023) | Target (FY2024) | Stretch (FY2024) | Quarterly Milestones |
|:---|:---|:---|:---|:---|:---|
| KR 1.1 | Increase Net Revenue Retention (NRR) | 118% | 122% | 125% | Q1: 119%, Q2: 120%, Q3: 121%, Q4: 122% |
| KR 1.2 | Improve Gross Revenue Retention (GRR) | 94% | 95% | 96% | Q1: 94.5%, Q2: 95%, Q3: 95.5%, Q4: 96% |
| KR 1.3 | Reduce annual customer churn (by count) | 385 (FY2023) | 300 | 250 | Q1: <96, Q2: <80, Q3: <70, Q4: <54 |
| KR 1.4 | Increase upsell/cross-sell revenue from existing customers | N/A | AED 50,000,000 | AED 60,000,000 | Q1: 10M, Q2: 12M, Q3: 13M, Q4: 15M |

### Objective 2: Achieve exceptional customer satisfaction and product advocacy across all product lines.

Customer satisfaction is a leading indicator of retention. This objective targets a significant lift in our Net Promoter Score (NPS) to solidify our position as a trusted partner in healthcare technology.

| Key Result (KR) | Metric | Baseline (Q4 2023) | Target (Q4 2024) | Stretch (Q4 2024) | Quarterly Milestones |
|:---|:---|:---|:---|:---|:---|
| KR 2.1 | Increase Overall Company NPS | 71 | 75 | 78 | Q1: 72, Q2: 73, Q3: 74, Q4: 75 |
| KR 2.2 | Elevate MedSync Analytics NPS | 68 | 72 | 75 | Q1: 69, Q2: 70, Q3: 71, Q4: 72 |
| KR 2.3 | Achieve a minimum NPS of 70 for all four product lines | 3/4 products > 70 | 4/4 products > 70 | 4/4 products > 75 | Q4: All products > 70 |
| KR 2.4 | Increase customer referenceable accounts (Hospitals) | 50 | 80 | 100 | Q1: 60, Q2: 70, Q3: 75, Q4: 80 |

### Objective 3: Scale Customer Success Operations and Team Efficiency to support 25% customer growth.

To effectively manage the projected growth in customer organizations (from **3,930** to over **4,900**), we must optimize our processes and ensure the CS team is fully enabled.

